### Voice Agent Chat API Test Requests
### Use this file with VS Code REST Client extension or similar tools

### 1. Test Root Endpoint
GET http://localhost:8000/

### 2. Test Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### 3. Test API Info
GET http://localhost:8000/api-info

### 4. Send a Chat Message
POST http://localhost:8000/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "text",
  "data": "Hello! Can you help me with travel information?",
  "user_id": "test-user-123",
  "user_name": "Test User",
  "token": "test-token-123"
}

### 5. Send Another Message (Same User - Should Use Same Session)
POST http://localhost:8000/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "text",
  "data": "Can you remember our previous conversation?",
  "user_id": "test-user-123",
  "user_name": "Test User",
  "token": "test-token-456"
}

### 6. Test Travel Hands Query
POST http://localhost:8000/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "text",
  "data": "What is the active journey for user 123?",
  "user_id": "test-user-123",
  "user_name": "Test User",
  "token": "test-token-789"
}

### 7. Get User's Session Summary
GET http://localhost:8000/sessions/test-user-123

### 8. Get User's Current Session
GET http://localhost:8000/sessions/test-user-123/current

### 9. Get Conversation History
GET http://localhost:8000/sessions/test-user-123/history?limit=10

### 10. Start New Session
POST http://localhost:8000/sessions/test-user-456/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_name": "Another Test User"
}

### 11. Test Different User
POST http://localhost:8000/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "text",
  "data": "Hello from a different user!",
  "user_id": "test-user-456",
  "user_name": "Another Test User",
  "token": "test-token-999"
}
